  "claim_boundary": "This source-pinned, failure-inclusive development packet measures two bounded generic compatibility relations on P0030's immutable seventh disjoint 20 ARC-AGI-1 plus 20 ARC-AGI-2 filename-only cohort. `contiguous_panel_cellwise_combine` derives one split axis and one panel count of at least three from every visible input/output geometry, requires unchanged cross-axis geometry, learns a conflict-free visible tuple-to-output table, and refuses unknown test tuples or ambiguous axes. `unique_component_crop` rederives a unique modal background and color-sensitive 4-connected non-background regions from each grid, then returns a crop only when exactly one crop occurs once and every other crop occurs exactly twice; it refuses background ties, fewer than three regions, duplicate-count ambiguity, and diagonal-only contact. P0030's immutable 2/40 source-pinned baseline is the same-cohort pre-change denominator. P0030 is exposed development evidence, so P0031 is development evidence only, not independent transfer evidence and not an ARC-AGI-1 or ARC-AGI-2 solver claim. The live controller receives only visible training input/output examples and test inputs. It receives no task ID, imported cohort metadata, GT feature contract, GT solver, historical decomposition, or held-out output before committing a complete grid. P0030 baseline bytes and reports remain immutable; P0031 results cannot retune this frozen controller or its operator vocabulary.",
